                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Benjamin's 2nd Film – 2017 ​IT'S NO GAME Benjamin collaborates on a script about Benjamin. ​ Starring David Hasselhoff, Sarah Hay, Tom Payne, ​Tim Guinee & Jake Broder Made in 48 hours for Sci-Fi London's 48hr Film Challenge. 3rd place. · Benjamin's 3rd Film - 2018 ZONE OUT Attempt to have Benjamin write & act & direct & score a film. Starring poor simulations of Thomas Middleditch, ​Elisabeth Grey & Humphrey Ker. Made in 48 hours for Sci-Fi London's 48hr Film Challenge. Disqualified for excessive use of existing footage."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
