                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "​INTERVIEWS ​​Ars Technica ​Chicago Tribune Arte FiveThirtyEight Popular Science NPR - The Pulse Canadian National Radio Australian National Radio Canal+ (French National TV) Slashfilm El Pais ​ ​ ​ARTICLES (200+ Worldwide) ​ ​The Guardian ​Indiewire‎ Sunspring: Herald of the Future Financial Times Daily Mail NPR Marketplace New York Post Dim the House Lights Le Monde (french) La Repubblica (italian) ​​Spiegel (german) Techcrunch Japan (japanese) Korea Times Motherboard ​Racked CBS News Singularity Hub Ladygeekgirl Mic Bustle The Mary Sue Daily Express International Business Times Irish Times Forbes Slate Big Think Inquisitr CNET BoingBoing Quartz A.V. Club Huffington Post io9 Kinja Gizmodo Techcrunch The Quint 9 News Australia Reddit Letterboxd Slashdot Kill Screen NoFilmSchool Engadget Fast Company Yahoo Tech Cinefiles Digital Spy Futurism Inquirer mental_floss Inverse Gear Patrol New Atlas ZME Science Collider Hypebeast TheNextWeb Comicbook Mashable The Film Stage BGR Silicon Republic Sputnik News Daily Dot Cyber Shack Blastr Catch News The Drive ​Mouv Radio (french) RTS (french) Fayerwayer (spanish) Mostaqbal (arabic) Estadao (portuguese) Agambiarra (portuguese) Reporterdiario (portuguese) Zeit (german) Computerra (russian) Goygoygoy (turkish) Business Day South Africa IBT India Bogoshorts · ​ONLINE & VIDEO ​​wikipedia.org/wiki/sunspring TWITTER ​trending peaked at 2 tweets per second Watch a short SF film gloriously fail the Turing Test: https://t.co/4uJRF3tC5z— Neil Gaiman (@neilhimself) June 10, 2016 Wow https://t.co/31eDpvMtu5— William Gibson (@GreatDismal) June 9, 2016 This sci fi film is written by AI algorithm, and it's magnificent. The actors fully commit. https://t.co/AnN0CNM4ln— ben goldacre (@bengoldacre) July 2, 2016 @MrOscarSharp @benjamin_ai @rossgoodwin: I guessed right. :) Benjamin is rather wordy and absurdist, yes?— Margaret E. Atwood (@MargaretAtwood) June 16, 2016 WIRED magazine ​Square Idée on ARTE AT&T SHAPE ​TEDxBOSTON ​Bloomberg ART + AI Keynote at GitHub Universe New York Magazine L'Oeil De Links - CANAL+ Sunspring - L'Oeil de Links du 08/10 ​CBC RADIO - \"q\" - Full Interview Discussion from 32:15, interview from 1:03:00. ​Instagram ​​YouTube - RickyFTW discusses Sunspring on ETC - 123K views. · ​GALLERIES Grand Palais Paris London Barbican London Science Museum Onassis Cultural Centre Athens BRANDTS, Odense, Denmark Kunstverein Frankfurt Seoul Museum of Art ​SPEAKING / EVENTS TEDx Boston Lincoln Centre Cannes Lions Sundance SXSW Berlinale AT&T SHAPE Santa Fe Institute Interplanetary festival NEXT Conference Seoul GitHub Universe Lillehammer University"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
